/E (The Nigeria FM industry Maturity Survey 1.0 employs a structured questionnaire aligned with the ISO 41001:2018 Facility Management Management System \(FMMS\) standard. The instrument comprises 50 assessment statements distributed across seven core dimensions of the standard, with responses captured on a 5 point Likert scale \(1 = Strongly Disagree to 5 = Strongly Agree\).)
