/K [2]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (The seven assessment dimensions correspond to the clause structure of ISO 41001:2018: \(1\) Context of the Organisation, \(2\) Leadership and Commitment, \(3\) Planning, \(4\) Support, \(5\) Operations, \(6\) Performance Evaluation, and \(7\) Improvement. Each dimension contains between 5 and 9 assessment statements designed to evaluate the degree of implementation and maturity of FMS practices within respondent organizations.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
