466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 154 0 R
/E (While Leadership and Commitment scores a respectable 3.58, the Planning \(3.40\) and Support \(3.38\) dimensions lag significantly behind \(-0.18 and -0.20 respectively\). This reveals a leadership and execution chasm: executive endorsement of FM as a strategic function exists, but the organizational investments required to translate that endorsement into documented plans, adequate resources, competency frameworks, and information management systems are missing.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
